  "body": "Direct-PR: daily docs-only fold of the pending fragments (`tooling/docs/fold.py` through `hygiene.py --apply`, README routine) and refresh of the README milestone table, under the operator's standing authorization; merged on green CI, no adversarial review for a docs-only fold.\n\nThe problem: two fragments (`docs/changelog-legacy.d/594.md` and `598.md`) were pending, and the README table showed M4 3 of 25 and M5 0 of 30.\n\nWhat changed: the two fragments folded into `docs/CHANGELOG-LEGACY.md` and `docs/migration/GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md` (counts regenerated by the tool), the fragment files removed, and the README table (date, M4 4 of 26, M5 0 of 29) from the board render.\n\nTests: `python3 tooling/docs/fold.py --check` passes (\"docs fold check: ok\").\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEBkjmFApUaMrewUvD)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the legacy changelog with details about message-menu positioning and titles, composer formatting controls, URL-tag options, and the image-send icon.\n  * Refreshed milestone progress and migration tracking counts.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
